  "scientific_limits": {
    "en": "Original low-poly reconstruction of shell form based mainly on VTT001-7 as reconstructed in Koppka2018 Text-fig4 and photographed Plate1 J-L. Reconstructed missing pointed end is an interpretation, not an exact preserved scan. {\"unit\": \"meters\", \"working_dimensions_mm\": {\"length_x\": 119, \"height_z\": 32, \"paired_inflation_y\": 19.6}, \"basis\": \"Paper p29 table VTT001-7 H=3.2cm, L=(11.9)cm, I=0.98cm; p27defines I as single-valve inflation. Thus nominal two-valve thickness about2I=19.6mm.\", \"uncertainty\": \"L is author-estimated from incomplete fossil, explicitly parenthesized. Thickness approximation assumes paired inflation; asymmetry is simplified. Not exact specimen geometry.\"}",
    "zh": "原创低多边形研究；形态、尺度及不确定性严格以本次已核参考为界。原始限定：Original low-poly reconstruction of shell form based mainly on VTT001-7 as reconstructed in Koppka2018 Text-fig4 and photographed Plate1 J-L. Reconstructed missing pointed end is an interpretation, not an exact preserved scan. {\"unit\": \"meters\", \"working_dimensions_mm\": {\"length_x\": 119, \"height_z\": 32, \"paired_inflation_y\": 19.6}, \"basis\": \"Paper p29 table VTT001-7 H=3.2cm, L=(11.9)cm, I=0.98cm; p27defines I as single-valve inflation. Thus nominal two-valve thickness about2I=19.6mm.\", \"uncertainty\": \"L is author-estimated from incomplete fossil, explicitly parenthesized. Thickness approximation assumes paired inflation; asymmetry is simplified. Not exact specimen geometry.\"}"
  },
